# ABOUT-16: A backgrounded intro survives process death on the page it was left
# on.
#
# The host restores and drives the existing task before phase two. Android Test
# Orchestrator force-stops the target before each instrumentation invocation, so
# the process-death restoration itself must be asserted outside instrumentation.
#
# The kill is host driven because instrumentation shares the app process. It is
# also the only way to reach this state: pressing Home puts the intro in the
# background, and only the system, or the runner standing in for it, can take
# the process away underneath it.
#
# Phase one clears package data and verifies the clean-install preferences. The
# host then creates and backgrounds the task after instrumentation has exited,
# because MonitoringInstrumentation finishes every activity at test completion.
describe A backgrounded intro survives process death on the page it was left on

# Verifies clean-install state without launching an activity. The host then
# launches onboarding, advances to page four, and backgrounds the task.
phase com.gitlab.mudlej.MjPdfReader.suite.about.About16ProcessDeathTest#phaseOneAssertCleanInstallOnboardingState

launch-task
assert-ui-text Welcome to MJ PDF
click-ui-text Next
assert-ui-text All your PDFs in one place
click-ui-text Next
assert-ui-text Made for long reading
click-ui-text Next
assert-ui-text Do more than read
record-app-task
device-shell input keyevent HOME
await-app-background
kill-app

restore-app-task
assert-ui-text Do more than read
click-ui-text Next
assert-ui-text Make it yours
click-ui-text Get started

# Depending on when Android recreates the Home activity under the restored
# intro, completion leaves either Home or its first-run release notes in front.
# Both are valid post-onboarding destinations; neither is part of the
# process-restoration contract.
assert-ui-any-text What's New || Library

# Phase two verifies the durable marker written only after the host observed the
# restored page, finished the intro, and reached a post-onboarding screen.
phase com.gitlab.mudlej.MjPdfReader.suite.about.About16ProcessDeathTest#phaseTwoAssertTheIntroCameBackOnTheSamePage
